\label{lem:SODintersection}
   Suppose ${\mathcal A}_1, \dots, {\mathcal A}_n \subseteq {\mathcal C}$ are idempotent complete, triangulated subcategories such that ${\mathcal C}_1 \subseteq \langle {\mathcal A}_1, \dots, {\mathcal A}_n \rangle \subseteq {\mathcal C}_1 \oplus {\mathcal C}_2$ for some triangulated subcategories ${\mathcal C}_1, {\mathcal C}_2 \subseteq {\mathcal C}$. Let ${\mathcal A}_{i,j} \coloneqq {\mathcal C}_j \cap {\mathcal A}_i$ for $1 \leq i \leq n$ and $j = 1,2$.
